This FIA is not a "gotta follow it" set of rules; rather, it is an 
actual set of questions, some of them frequently asked, all of them 
useful knowledge.

More good stuff to read is posted at least once a week to the newsgroups 
alt.2600 and alt.2600.hackerz (and sometimes others) by a bot called 
Harlequin, under several subjects. The material is several years old, 
and in some cases is extremely out of date, but nonetheless, it's still 
good to read.

Before you read this FIA, I (Auric__) am going to give you my single 
best piece of advice: DON'T HACK! Obviously, the laws will vary from 
country to country, but most activities commonly referred to as 
"hacking" by the press are potentially illegal and could get you 
arrested.


NON-CLAIMER
This is not intended to be read as "go forth with our blessing"; this is 
just a collection of things that we understand to be true. Don't read 
any more into it than that.

